%% Arrows inside a region are unlabeled and explained on that set's page. Labeled arrows between regions say how the sets connect. Cylinder = stored state, stadium = state, thick border = a UNNotificationRequest is added here, thick arrow = done by iOS, line without an arrowhead = runs in.
%% Sets: capture-sequence.mmd, task-lifecycle.mmd, copy-sequence.mmd, session-lifecycle.mmd, notification-flow.mmd, system-context.mmd. Page: docs/diagrams/index.html.
